{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35149","headline":"诗品二十四则 高古 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 高古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"畸人乘真，手把芙蓉。\n泛彼浩劫，窅然空纵。\n月出东斗，好风相从。\n太华夜碧，人闻清钟。\n虚伫神素，脱然畦封。\n黄唐在独，落落玄宗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}